<item>
  <title>Which NFL Teams Get Called for Roughing the Passer the Most?</title>
  <dc:creator>Riley Herndon</dc:creator>
  <link>https://your-website-url.example.com/posts/teams-with-the-most-roughing-the-passer-penalties/</link>
  <description><![CDATA[ 





<p>Roughing the passer is one of those penalties that can get fans talking pretty quickly. It can keep a drive alive, give an offense extra yards and sometimes have a big impact on the outcome of a game. But do some NFL teams get called for it more than others?</p>
<p>Taking a closer look at that question by looking at roughing-the-passer penalties across the NFL since 2014. By comparing teams, looking at the seasons with the most calls and tracking the numbers over time, we can see which teams stand out.</p>
