<p>Which NFL teams have been called the most?</p>
<p>The first chart shows the total number of roughing-the-passer penalties for each NFL team since 2014. It gives us a chance to see which teams have been called the most and which ones have stayed toward the bottom. Some teams have much higher totals than others, which makes it interesting to see how those numbers compare across the league. With the Ravens and Jets having the most and the most surprising team in the Chicago Bears being third.</p>
