<p>What team had the most in one season?</p>
<p>Total penalties over several years only tell part of the story. A team might not be near the top overall but could have had one season where it was called for roughing the passer a lot. The second chart shows the 10 highest team totals in a single season since 2014. This gives us a better look at some of the biggest seasons and shows which teams had the most trouble with this penalty in one year. With the 2020 N.Y. Jets having the most in a season with 14, follow by 2019 Baltimore Ravens with 11. But, one team with has a chance this year to break that record that being the Green Bay Packers. At the pace they are on right now they will break the record by one game.</p>
